<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK RESERVES UP FIM 280 MILLION IN WEEK.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK RESERVES UP FIM 280 MILLION IN WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest</p>
<p>balance sheet for the week to October 15 showed the following</p>
<p>positions in millions of markka compared to October 8 SPFC:</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 37,089	 36,809</p>
<p> Money market intervention    11,803	 11,803</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		5,999	  5,999</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,426	  2,428</p>
<p> Total assets		     65,295	 65,080</p>
<p>In the previous week, to October 8, reserves rose by 1.49</p>
<p>billion markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
